- Added `GET /api/latest/fleet/hosts/:id/integration_status`, returning normalized third-party coverage
  status (antivirus, MDR, remote access, backups, disk encryption) per host as a vendor-agnostic "host
  integration status" store — like the MacAdmins card, but generic. Providers write per-host cells; the
  read path renders cells older than a per-category freshness window as "unknown" so stale data is never
  shown as covered.
